---
// Section: Brand Statement & Philosophy (Raw Gig Culture Dossier — Built in the Moshpit)
---

<section id="about" class="relative w-full py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 lg:px-12 bg-[#FAF7F9] dark:bg-void-black border-t border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.06] overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300">
  
  <!-- Subtle Background Diagonal Speed Lines -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20">
    <div class="w-full h-full" style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(209,77,145,0.05) 0, rgba(209,77,145,0.05) 1px, transparent 0, transparent 40px);"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Hero Dossier Canvas Container -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#120B10] border border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/15 p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 shadow-xl dark:shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300">
      
      <!-- Ambient Stage Glow Backdrop -->
      <div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-electric-magenta/15 dark:bg-electric-magenta/20 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-deep-magenta/20 dark:bg-deep-magenta/30 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Main Asymmetric Grid: 7 Cols Left (Identity & Origin), 5 Cols Right (Stage Euphoria Visual Collage) -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center relative z-10">
        
        <!-- LEFT COLUMN: The Genesis & Identity of Afterglow (7 Cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-7">
          
          <!-- Section Tag -->
          <div data-animate="reveal" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-electric-magenta/15 text-electric-magenta border border-electric-magenta/30">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-electric-magenta animate-pulse"></span>
              ORIGIN & IDENTITY // WHO WE ARE
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 dark:text-muted-gray">EST. 2026 // INDONESIA</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Main Impact Title -->
          <div data-animate="reveal" class="delay-100">
            <h2 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-neutral-950 dark:text-soft-white tracking-wide leading-[0.95]">
              BUILT IN THE MOSHPIT.<br />
              <span class="text-electric-magenta">ENGINEERED FOR TRUE FANS.</span>
            </h2>
            <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-electric-magenta to-transparent mt-4"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- The Real "About" Story (Authentic concert emotion) -->
          <div data-animate="reveal" class="delay-200 space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-700 dark:text-soft-white/90 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            <p class="text-neutral-950 dark:text-white font-medium text-lg sm:text-xl leading-snug">
              <strong class="text-electric-magenta font-bold">AFTERGLOW</strong> bukan startup korporat yang melihat penonton musik sebagai angka monetisasi. Kami didirikan oleh orang-orang yang tumbuh di depan panggung konser.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-muted-gray leading-relaxed">
              Kami muak melihat bot calo memborong tiket dalam 2 detik, fans sejati dipaksa membeli 4x lipat di media sosial, dan sistem tiket jadul yang selalu crash di detik pertama war. 
              AFTERGLOW lahir sebagai perlawanan: platform tiket direct-to-promoter dengan zero scalper tolerance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 3 Clear Brand Pillars -->
          <div data-animate="reveal" class="delay-300 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-electric-magenta/50 transition-colors">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-electric-magenta block uppercase font-bold mb-1">01 // WHY WE EXIST</span>
              <h4 class="font-display text-xl text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-1">ANTI-BOT ALLIANCE</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-muted-gray leading-snug font-mono">Mematikan spekulan calo & multi-tab bot farming.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-electric-magenta/50 transition-colors">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-electric-magenta block uppercase font-bold mb-1">02 // INVENTORY PLEDGE</span>
              <h4 class="font-display text-xl text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-1">100% PROMOTOR DIRECT</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-muted-gray leading-snug font-mono">Kuota murni langsung dari label, promotor & venue.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-electric-magenta/50 transition-colors">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-electric-magenta block uppercase font-bold mb-1">03 // GATE SPEED</span>
              <h4 class="font-display text-xl text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-1">0.3s TURNSTILE TAP</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-muted-gray leading-snug font-mono">Dynamic rotating QR pass anti-screenshot di pintu masuk.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Founder Note & CTA -->
          <div data-animate="reveal" class="delay-300 pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-muted-gray">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-electric-magenta/20 text-electric-magenta font-bold">CREED</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-800 dark:text-soft-white italic">"Musik panggung milik mereka yang datang dan bernyanyi bersama."</span>
            </div>
            <a 
              href="/events" 
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-electric-magenta hover:bg-electric-magenta/90 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(209,77,145,0.4)]"
            >
              <span>EXPLORE GIGS</span>
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT COLUMN: High-Impact Concert Visual Collage & Stage Pass Artifact (5 Cols) -->
        <div data-animate="reveal" class="delay-200 lg:col-span-5 relative flex items-center justify-center pt-4 lg:pt-0">
          
          <div class="relative w-full max-w-md">
            
            <!-- Main Euphoric Stage Photo (Crowd singalong & laser atmosphere) -->
            <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-neutral-300 dark:border-white/20 shadow-2xl group bg-neutral-900">
              <img 
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" 
                alt="Euphoric concert crowd singing under magenta lights" 
                class="w-full h-80 sm:h-96 object-cover filter contrast-125 saturate-125 transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 select-none"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-void-black via-void-black/30 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>

              <!-- Top Tape Badge -->
              <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 tape-effect px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-soft-white tracking-wider uppercase select-none">
                MOSHPIT CERTIFIED // ARCHIVE 01
              </div>

              <!-- Bottom Overlay on Photo -->
              <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 flex items-end justify-between font-mono text-xs select-none">
                <div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-muted-gray block">VENUE COORDINATES</span>
                  <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-wider">JAKARTA • BANDUNG • BALI</span>
                </div>
                <!-- Live EQ Visualizer -->
                <div class="flex items-end gap-1 h-6">
                  <span class="w-1 bg-electric-magenta eq-bar" style="animation-delay: 0.1s"></span>
                  <span class="w-1 bg-electric-magenta eq-bar" style="animation-delay: 0.4s"></span>
                  <span class="w-1 bg-white eq-bar" style="animation-delay: 0.2s"></span>
                  <span class="w-1 bg-electric-magenta eq-bar" style="animation-delay: 0.6s"></span>
                  <span class="w-1 bg-white eq-bar" style="animation-delay: 0.3s"></span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Floating Backstage All-Access Badge (Layered over photo) -->
            <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-4 sm:-left-8 w-60 sm:w-64 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-[#180F16]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-neutral-200 dark:border-electric-magenta/40 shadow-xl dark:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] font-mono transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-electric-magenta uppercase tracking-wider">STAGE PASS IDENTITY</span>
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-950 dark:text-white tracking-wide leading-tight">
                ANTI-CALO PROTOCOL
              </div>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-neutral-600 dark:text-muted-gray mt-1 leading-snug">
                Setiap tiket terikat identitas unik dan diverifikasi secara kriptografis di gerbang turnstile.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 flex justify-between text-[9px] text-neutral-500 dark:text-white/70">
                <span>VERIFIED SYSTEM</span>
                <span class="text-electric-magenta font-bold">100% BOT RESISTANT</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Floating Top Right Decibel Seal -->
            <div class="absolute -top-6 -right-3 sm:-right-6 w-24 h-24 sm:w-28 sm:h-28 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-[#180F16] border border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/15 p-2 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center shadow-xl font-mono select-none">
              <div class="w-full h-full rounded-full border border-dashed border-electric-magenta/60 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-1">
                <span class="text-[9px] text-electric-magenta font-bold">PEAK SOUND</span>
                <span class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-950 dark:text-white leading-none my-0.5">118 dB</span>
                <span class="text-[7px] text-neutral-500 dark:text-muted-gray">SUB-BASS 35Hz</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tape-effect {
    background: rgba(209, 77, 145, 0.35);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    border-left: 2px dashed rgba(209, 77, 145, 0.8);
    border-right: 2px dashed rgba(209, 77, 145, 0.8);
  }

  @keyframes audioPulse {
    0%, 100% { height: 6px; }
    50% { height: 24px; }
  }

  .eq-bar {
    animation: audioPulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
</style>
